# Apply to GNOME Snapshot tag 50.0 (commit 79cc14698813).
#
# Keeps the existing nabu viewfinder orientation correction, bypasses the
# redundant decoder for raw PipeWire/libcamera streams, and adds separate
# high-resolution 4:3 caps for still capture while retaining a 1080p preview.
